# Only US-differing strings from UK; others fall back to `english-uk.lng`

STR_PARAM_E88A9CA_COLOUR                    :Wuhu Station - Decoration Color
STR_PARAM_E88A9CA_COLOUR_DESC               :Choose what color to use for the decorations in Wuhu Station. The real world counterpart is white during daytime, and displays ever-changing colors with LED lights during night.
STR_PARAM_E88A9CA_COLOUR_2                  :Wuhu Station - Decoration Color 2
STR_PARAM_E88A9CA_COLOUR_2_DESC             :Choose what color to use for the decorations in Wuhu Station. The real world counterpart is white during daytime, and displays ever-changing colors with LED lights during night.

STR_PARAM_E88A9CA_COLOUR_STYLE_DESC         :Choose the style to apply the decoration colors.

STR_PARAM_STATION_COLOUR_PRIMARY            :Use Primary Company Color
STR_PARAM_STATION_COLOUR_SECONDARY          :Use Secondary Company Color
STR_PARAM_STATION_COLOUR_GREY               :Gray

STR_PARAM_E88A9C4_COLOUR                    :Wuhu Station (1992) - Decoration Color
STR_PARAM_E88A9C4_COLOUR_DESC               :Choose what color to use for the decoration of Wuhu Station (1992).

STR_PARAM_E88A9C0_COLOUR                    :Wuhu Station (1934) - Decoration Color
STR_PARAM_E88A9C0_COLOUR_DESC               :Choose what color to use for the windows and door of Wuhu Station (1934).
STR_PARAM_E88A9C0_COLOUR_2                  :Wuhu Station (1934) - Decoration Color 2
STR_PARAM_E88A9C0_COLOUR_2_DESC             :Choose what color to use for the window decorations of Wuhu Station (1934).

STR_PARAM_E9B8A0A_COLOUR                    :Wuhubei Station - Decoration Color
STR_PARAM_E9B8A0A_COLOUR_DESC               :Choose what color to use for the decoration of Wuhubei Station.

STR_PARAM_E5BC8BA_COLOUR                    :Wuhunan Station - Decoration Color
STR_PARAM_E5BC8BA_COLOUR_DESC               :Choose what color to use for the decoration of Wuhunan Station.

STR_PARAM_E697A0A_COLOUR                    :Wuwei Station - Decoration Color
STR_PARAM_E697A0A_COLOUR_DESC               :Choose what color to use for the decoration of Wuwei Station.

STR_PARAM_E6B9BES_COLOUR                    :Wanzhinan Station - Decoration Color
STR_PARAM_E6B9BES_COLOUR_DESC               :Choose what color to use for the decoration of Wanzhinan Station.

STR_PARAM_E999B5A_COLOUR                    :Nanling Station - Decoration Color
STR_PARAM_E999B5A_COLOUR_DESC               :Choose what color to use for the decoration of Nanling Station.

STR_PARAM_E7B981W_COLOUR                    :Fanchangxi Station - Decoration Color
STR_PARAM_E7B981W_COLOUR_DESC               :Choose what color to use for the decoration of Fanchangxi Station.

